==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*4 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage has exclusively Red enemies, with Nyandam as the boss, spawning couple of seconds after the stage starts. None are too strong, so your normal anti-Red CC and DPS units like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] will demolish this stage.

==Trivia==
*Nyaku Domain is named after the Japanese word 蒟蒻 ''konnyaku'' (konjac).

